---
title: Security Architecture - 9 Defensive Layers
---
flowchart TD
    A["POST /query"] --> L1["L1 Pydantic Validation<br/>length, empty input, regex injection patterns"]
    L1 --> L4A["L4a JWT Authentication<br/>get_current_user"]
    L4A --> L4B["L4b Rate Limiting<br/>per-user sliding window"]
    L4B --> L6["L6 Token Budget<br/>daily per-user token cap"]
    L6 --> L5["L5 Input Restructuring<br/>truncate or summarize long input"]
    L5 --> L2["L2 Input Guard<br/>llm-guard prompt injection, toxicity, ban topics"]
    L2 --> L7A["L7a Input Moderation + PII Redaction"]
    L7A --> Graph["LangGraph Invoke"]
    Graph --> L3["L3 Hardened System Prompt<br/>user input is untrusted"]
    L3 --> L8["L8 Spotlighting<br/>retrieved chunks wrapped as data"]
    L8 --> Gen["LLM Generation"]
    Gen --> L7B["L7b Output Moderation + PII Redaction"]
    L7B --> L9["L9 Output Validation<br/>Pydantic schema + retry path"]
    L9 --> Response["ChatResponse"]
